<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="ko"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" leadingSilence="0.260"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="en-US"><text for="L21">Either way, you're good</text><text for="L20">You know what—let’s just go with V</text><text for="L23">It's not about who's right or wrong</text><text for="L22">We're all good</text><text for="L25">Either way, you're good</text><text for="L24">Just as we all love in our own way</text><text for="L27">I, I, I, another me</text><text for="L26">Either way</text><text for="L29">It's not about who's right or wrong</text><text for="L28">Me, me, me.</text><text for="L1">Someone said I sound full of myself</text><text for="L2">That I'm just showing off</text><text for="L3">Someone else said I'm too kind</text><text for="L4">Like a soft fool</text><text for="L30">Just as we all live in our own way</text><text for="L5">Sometimes I don't even understand the looks I get</text><text for="L6">It feels a bit unfair, but</text><text for="L10">We're all good</text><text for="L32">Love and hatred</text><text for="L7">I get to talk with all version of me misunderstood</text><text for="L31">We're all good</text><text for="L8">All of us, we're me</text><text for="L12">Just as we all love in our own way</text><text for="L34">No need to choose just one</text><text for="L9">Either way, I'm good</text><text for="L11">It's not about who's right or wrong</text><text for="L33">We can just have them all</text><text for="L14">Either way</text><text for="L36">Smile for each other, woo-hoo-hoo</text><text for="L13">Either way, I'm good</text><text for="L35">Either way, we're good</text><text for="L16">Some say she acts too childish</text><text for="L15">She's a friend I look up to like an eonni</text><text f